ving project has 2BHK premium residences with -\u003cbr\u003e2BHK - (604 to 719) sqft\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVeena Blissful Living floor plan\u003cbr\u003eTower floor plan will have 6 flats, 2 lifts \u0026amp; 1 staircase on each floor\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVeena Blissful Living Mumbai Prices \u0026amp; its details can be found in the price section \u0026amp; Veena Blissful Living Kandivali West brochure can be downloaded from "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers \u0026amp; Veena Developers Kandivali West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\u003c/p\u003e1d:T683,\u003cp\u003eVeena Kandivali West Project Overview\u003cbr\u003eVeena Blissful Living Project will be constructed on 1 acre of land parcel, 1 tower with G+38 floors having 2 BHK premium residences.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVeena Blissful Living location\u003cbr\u003eProject is located Near Mathuradas Rd, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai with -\u003cbr\u003eDahanukarwadi Metro Station - 600m\u003cbr\u003eSV Road - 1.2km\u003cbr\u003eInfinity Mall - 2.7km\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVeena Blissful Living Kandivali West Project Amenities\u003cbr\u003eFirst is Internal amenities -\u003cbr\u003eVitrified Tiles, Granite Platform, Concealed Copper Wiring, Stainless Steel Sink, Branded Fittings \u0026amp; many more\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVeena Developers Kandivali West External Amenities\u003cbr\u003eProject has 25+ luxurious amenities with likes of -\u003cbr\u003eGymnasium\u003cbr\u003eKids Play Area\u003cbr\u003eClubhouse\u003cbr\u003eYoga Meditation Deck\u003cbr\u003eSenior Citizen Area \u0026amp; Many More\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVeena Developers Blissful Living Kandivali West Parking -\u003cbr\u003eProject has one type of car parking facility -\u003cbr\u003e1) Parking Tower\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVeena Blissful Living Possession -\u003cbr\u003eRera Possession - December 2030\u003cbr\u003eTarget Possession - December 2029\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCarpet Area \u0026amp; Floor Plan\u003cbr\u003eBlissful Living project has 2BHK premium residences with -\u003cbr\u003e2BHK - (604 to 719) sqft\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVeena Blissful Living floor plan\u003cbr\u003eTower floor plan will have 6 flats, 2 lifts \u0026amp; 1 staircase on each floor\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVeena Blissful Living Mumbai Prices \u0026amp; its details can be found in the price section \u0026amp; Veena Blissful Living Kandivali West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers \u0026amp; Veena Developers Kandivali West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\u003c/p\u003e1e:T458,Since its inception in 1990, Veena Developers have successfully delivered Residential, Corporate and Industrial Spaces with the essence of modernisation. Our persistent aim is to o"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ffer high-quality construction while also providing amenities for the convenience of our customers and their luxurious lifestyle.\r\nWe at Veena Developers have always believed that Integrity, Honesty and Trust are the pillars of our strength and we always strive to establish a long-term connection with our clients, one based on a solid foundation of trust. Our highly competent team of professionals perceive it as a mission to consistently work with a customer centric approach. We want our customers to feel comfortable and secure as we assist them in realising their goal of having a dream home that is not only a mark of their wealth but also a reflection of their lifestyle.\r\nWith Leadership of more than 30 years in the Real Estate industry, we believe that it is only the beginning for Veena Developers and that we have many more decades to demonstrate our endeavour to provide hassle-free customer experience in the Sector.20:T5a2,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"RealEstateListing\",\"name\":\"Veena Blissful Living Kandivali West\",\"description\":\"Veena Developers Launch - Veena Blissful Living Kandivali West, 1 Acre, 1 Tower, G+38 Floors, 2BHK [604 - 719] sqft, Near Mathuradas Rd, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai\",\"url\":\"https://housiey.com/projects/veena-blissful-living\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Near Mathuradas Rd, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai\",\"addressLocality\":\"Kandivali West\",\"addressRegion\":\"Maharashtra\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"floorSize\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"minValue\":604,\"maxValue\":719,\"unitCode\":\"FTK\"},\"numberOfRooms\":\"2BHK\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateOffer\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"lowPrice\":\"18600000\",\"highPrice\":\"21900000\",\"url\":\"https://housiey.com/projects/veena-blissful-living\"},\"additionalProperty\":[{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"RERA Number\",\"value\":\"NA\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Target Possession\",\"value\":\"01 December 2029\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"RERA Possession\",\"value\":\"01 December 2030\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Land "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"Parcel\",\"value\":1},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Total Towers\",\"value\":1},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Total Floors\",\"value\":\"G+38\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Litigation\",\"value\":\"No\"}],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Veena Developers\"},\"broker\":{\"@type\":\"RealEstateAgent\",\"name\":\"Housiey\",\"url\":\"https://housiey.com\"}}21:T2847,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I visit the sample flat of Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The sample flat is not ready yet. However, Housiey provides detailed floor plans, 3D walkthroughs, and virtual consultations with a property expert. Our team can explain the layout, unit sizes, and project details in detail.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the expected possession date of Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The expected possession date is 01 December 2030 as per RERA. Construction is currently 5% complete as of August 4, 2026. Target possession is 01 December 2029.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is there any litigation against Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What amenities are available in Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"This project offers 15+ amenities. Key external amenities include Multi purpose hall, Terrace Garden, Gymnasium, party lawn, and Seating Area. Internal specifications include Branded Fittings and Stainless Steel Sink. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What are the monthly maintenance charges for Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Monthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the carpet area of a 2BHK in Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"In Veena Blissful Living, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:• 604 sq. ft.• 620 sq. ft.• 649 sq. ft.• 719 sq. ft.Each configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Veena Blissful Living starts from ₹1.86 Cr and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.\\n\\n• 604 sq. ft. – ₹1.86 Cr (all-inclusive)• 620 sq. ft. – ₹1.90 Cr (all-inclusive)• 649 sq. ft. – ₹1.99 Cr (all-inclusive)• 719 sq. ft. – ₹2.19 Cr (all-inclusive)The price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What are the floor plans and configurations available in Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It is built across 1 acres with 1 towers with G+38 floors. Each floor has 6 flats per floor, 2 lifts, 1 staircases. It is available in 2BHK configurations with carpet areas ranging from 604 to 719 sq. ft.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What type of parking is available in Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Veena Blissful Living provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Veena Blissful Living project page on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Where is Veena Blissful Living located? What are the nearby landmarks?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It is located at Near Mathuradas Rd, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai.Nearby landmarks include:• Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 600m • SV Road - 1.2km • Infinity Mall - 2.7km \"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What payment plans are available for Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The following payment plans are available:• CLP ( Construction Link plan) - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment  as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%Note: In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the minimum down payment required for Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The minimum down payment starts from ₹28.00 Lacs, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is Veena Blissful Living approved by banks for home loans?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, it is approved by leading banks including Central Bank of India, Union Bank of India, Bank Of India, Bank Of Baroda, Citi Bank, Kotak Mahindra Bank, Axis Bank, State Bank Of India, ICICI Bank, HDFC BANK. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is there any brokerage when buying Veena Blissful Living through Housiey?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who is the developer of Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It is developed by Veena Developers, a trusted real estate brand with over 34 years of experience and more than 30 completed projects across Mumbai City and Mumbai suburban.Some of their notable developments include: • Veena Elevated Living in Borivali West, Mumbai • Veena One Luxe in Andheri West, Mumbai • Veena Synergy in Andheri East, Mumbai • Veena Suyog in Malad West, Mumbai • Veena Smart Homes in Kandivali West, Mumbai\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does Veena Blissful Living have CC and OC approvals?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Commencement Certificate is available. The Occupancy Certificate (OC) will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I book a site visit for Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.Alternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can NRIs buy a flat in Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why is Veena Blissful Living considered a good investment?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Kandivali West is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.This project by Veena Developers - with 34 years of experience - offers 2BHK at ₹1.86 Cr to ₹2.19 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why should I buy Veena Blissful Living through Housiey instead of directly from the builder?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Buying through Housiey gives you:(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price(2) Free Ola cab site visit(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal(5) Honest Pros \u0026 Cons review on every projectAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How can I download the price sheet or brochure of Veena Blissful Living?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \\\"Price Sheet\\\" or \\\"Brochure\\\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is Housiey's rating and how many customers have bought homes through Housiey?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Housiey has a 4.8 rating on Google with 2,395+ reviews.Over 8,500 families have purchased homes through Housiey across 8+ cities with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted 1.2 lakh+ free site visits and facilitated over ₹8,000 crore worth of property transactions.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"8:[[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"projectId\":5419,\"projectSlug\":\"veena-blissful-living\",\"projectName\":\"Veena Blissful Living\",\"sellerInfo\":\"[{\\\"seller_id\\\":1044,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Shabbir Shaikh\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"shabbir.shaikh@housiey.com\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"7700914406\\\",\\\"profile_photo\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"datetime\\\":\\\"2022-11-27T03:20:42.000Z\\\",\\\"replaced_by\\\":null,\\\"replaced_by_id\\\":0,\\\"suspended\\\":1,\\\"suspended_datetime\\\":null,\\\"password\\\":\\\"$2b$10$dlH2bQ/j1UnISRMSPRL66Ow4b4pp1/hylkhnD3FyFHwFSJKxH58wq\\\",\\\"city_id\\\":15,\\\"remark\\\":null}]\"}],[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"pageType\":\"detail\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[#F9F9F9]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"newCity\":{\"city_id\":15,\"name\":\"Mumbai\"},\"propertyType\":\"apartments\"}],[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"projectData\":{\"res\":true,\"status\":200,\"project\":[{\"id\":5419,\"project_name\":\"Veena Blissful Living\",\"slug\":\"veena-blissful-living\",\"project_title\":\"Veena Blissful Living Kandivali West - Brochure, Pros\u0026Cons, PriceSheet\",\"project_main_heading\":\"Veena Blissful Living Kandivali West\",\"project_desc\":\"Veena Developers Launch - Veena Blissful Living Kandivali West, 1 Acre, 1 Tower, G+38 Floors, 2BHK [604 - 719] sqft, Near Mathuradas Rd, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai\",\"meta_tags\":\"veena kandivali wes, veena developers kandivali we