:\"Bank Of Baroda\",\"logo\":\"admin/uploads/banks/1647076922780-img.webp\"},{\"name\":\"Bank Of India\",\"logo\":\"admin/uploads/banks/1647076911521-img.webp\"},{\"name\":\"Union Bank of India\",\"logo\":\"admin/uploads/banks/1647076899945-img.webp\"},{\"name\":\"Central Bank of India\",\"logo\":\"admin/uploads/banks/1647076883984-img.webp\"}],\"rera_details\":[{\"rera_no\":\"NA\",\"rera_link\":\"\",\"rera_qr_image\":null}],\"litigation_details\":[],\"legal_doc_records\":[],\"interestRate\":7.5}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"md:hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{\"projectName\":\"Veena Blissful Living\",\"localityName\":\"Kandivali West\",\"projectId\":5419}]}],[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"overviewData\":{\"land_parcel\":1,\"project_heading\":\"Veena Blissful Living\",\"area_range_min\":604,\"area_range_max\":719,\"rera_details\":\"$8:2:props:children:1:props:projectData:rera_details\",\"target_possession\":\"01 December 2029\",\"rera_possession\":\"01 December 2030\",\"no_of_towers\":1,\"no_of_floors\":\"G+38\",\"config\":\"2BHK\",\"about\":\"$1d\",\"possession_status\":\"New Launch (3+ yrs)\",\"litigation\":\"No\",\"project_city\":\"Mumbai\"},\"faqData\":{\"status\":200,\"success\":true,\"data\":{\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"Can I visit the sample flat of Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"The sample flat is not ready yet. However, Housiey provides detailed floor plans, 3D walkthroughs, and virtual consultations with a property expert. Our team can explain the layout, unit sizes, and project details in detail.\",\"category\":\"Site Visit\"},{\"question\":\"What is the expected possession date of Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"The expected possession date is \u003cb\u003e01 December 2030\u003c/b\u003e as per RERA. Construction is currently \u003cb\u003e5%\u003c/b\u003e complete as of August 4, 2026. Target possession is \u003cb\u003e01 December 2029\u003c/b\u003e.\",\"category\":\"Timeline\"},{\"question\":\"Is there any litigation against Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"No, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\",\"category\":\"Legal \u0026 Compliance\"},{\"question\":\"What amenities are available in Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"This project offers \u003cb\u003e15+\u003c/b\u003e amenities. Key external amenities include Multi purpose hall, Terrace Garden, Gymnasium, party lawn, and Seating Area.\u003cbr\u003e Internal specifications include Branded Fittings and Stainless Steel Sink. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\",\"category\":\"Amenities\"},{\"question\":\"What are the monthly maintenance charges for Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"Monthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\",\"category\":\"Pricing\"},{\"question\":\"What is the carpet area of a 2BHK in Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"In Veena Blissful Living, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003e604 sq. ft.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003e620 sq. ft.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003e649 sq. ft.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003e719 sq. ft.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\",\"category\":\"Configuration\"},{\"question\":\"What is the all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"The all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Veena Blissful Living starts from \u003cb\u003e₹1.86 Cr\u003c/b\u003e and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.\\n\\n\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003e604 sq. ft.\u003c/b\u003e – ₹1.86 Cr (all-inclusive)\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003e620 sq. ft.\u003c/b\u003e – ₹1.90 Cr (all-inclusive)\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003e649 sq. ft.\u003c/b\u003e – ₹1.99 Cr (all-inclusive)\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003e719 sq. ft.\u003c/b\u003e – ₹2.19 Cr (all-inclusive)\u003cbr\u003eThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\",\"category\":\"Pricing\"},{\"question\":\"What are the floor plans and configurations available in Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"It is built across \u003cb\u003e1 acres\u003c/b\u003e with \u003cb\u003e1\u003c/b\u003e towers with \u003cb\u003eG+38\u003c/b\u003e floors. Each floor has \u003cb\u003e6\u003c/b\u003e flats per floor, \u003cb\u003e2\u003c/b\u003e lifts, \u003cb\u003e1\u003c/b\u003e staircases. It is available in \u003cb\u003e2BHK\u003c/b\u003e configurations with carpet areas ranging from \u003cb\u003e604\u003c/b\u003e to \u003cb\u003e719 sq. ft.\u003c/b\u003e\",\"category\":\"Configuration\"},{\"question\":\"What type of parking is available in Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"Veena Blissful Living provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Veena Blissful Living project page on Housiey.\",\"category\":\"Configuration\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Veena Blissful Living located? What are the nearby landmarks?\",\"answer\":\"It is located at \u003cb\u003eNear Mathuradas Rd, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003eNearby landmarks include:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 600m \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• SV Road - 1.2km \u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Infinity Mall - 2.7km \u003c/b\u003e\",\"category\":\"Location\"},{\"question\":\"What payment plans are available for Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"The following payment plans are available:\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eCLP ( Construction Link plan)\u003c/b\u003e - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment  as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eNote:\u003c/b\u003e In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\",\"category\":\"Payment\"},{\"question\":\"What is the minimum down payment required for Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"The minimum down payment starts from \u003cb\u003e₹28.00 Lacs\u003c/b\u003e, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\",\"category\":\"Payment\"},{\"question\":\"Is Veena Blissful Living approved by banks for home loans?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it is approved by leading banks including \u003cb\u003eCentral Bank of India\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eUnion Bank of India\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eBank Of India\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eBank Of Baroda\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eCiti Bank\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eKotak Mahindra Bank\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eAxis Bank\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eState Bank Of India\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eICICI Bank\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eHDFC BANK\u003c/b\u003e. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\",\"category\":\"Payment\"},{\"question\":\"Is there any brokerage when buying Veena Blissful Living through Housiey?\",\"answer\":\"No - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\",\"category\":\"Payment\"},{\"question\":\"Who is the developer of Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"It is developed by \u003cb\u003eVeena Developers\u003c/b\u003e, a trusted real estate brand with over \u003cb\u003e34 years\u003c/b\u003e of experience and more than \u003cb\u003e30 completed projects\u003c/b\u003e across \u003cb\u003eMumbai City and Mumbai suburban\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSome of their notable developments include:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e • \u003cb\u003eVeena Elevated Living\u003c/b\u003e in Borivali West, Mumbai\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e • \u003cb\u003eVeena One Luxe\u003c/b\u003e in Andheri West, Mumbai\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e • \u003cb\u003eVeena Synergy\u003c/b\u003e in Andheri East, Mumbai\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e • \u003cb\u003eVeena Suyog\u003c/b\u003e in Malad West, Mumbai\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e • \u003cb\u003eVeena Smart Homes\u003c/b\u003e in Kandivali West, Mumbai\",\"category\":\"Developer\"},{\"question\":\"Does Veena Blissful Living have CC and OC approvals?\",\"answer\":\"The Commencement Certificate is available. The \u003cb\u003eOccupancy Certificate (OC)\u003c/b\u003e will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\",\"category\":\"Legal \u0026 Compliance\"},{\"question\":\"Can I book a site visit for Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"Yes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\",\"category\":\"Site Visit\"},{\"question\":\"Can NRIs buy a flat in Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"Yes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\",\"category\":\"Buying Process\"},{\"question\":\"Why is Veena Blissful Living considered a good investment?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cb\u003eKandivali West\u003c/b\u003e is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis project by \u003cb\u003eVeena Developers\u003c/b\u003e - with 34 years of experience - offers 2BHK at ₹1.86 Cr to ₹2.19 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\",\"category\":\"Investment\"},{\"question\":\"Why should I buy Veena Blissful Living through Housiey instead of directly from the builder?\",\"answer\":\"Buying through Housiey gives you:\u003cbr\u003e(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price\u003cbr\u003e(2) Free Ola cab site visit\u003cbr\u003e(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home\u003cbr\u003e(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal\u003cbr\u003e(5) Honest Pros \u0026 Cons review on every project\u003cbr\u003eAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\",\"category\":\"Housiey\"},{\"question\":\"How can I download the price sheet or brochure of Veena Blissful Living?\",\"answer\":\"The price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \\\"Price Sheet\\\" or \\\"Brochure\\\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\",\"category\":\"Housiey\"},{\"question\":\"What is Housiey's rating and how many customers have bought homes through Housiey?\",\"answer\":\"Housiey has a \u003cb\u003e4.8 rating\u003c/b\u003e on Google with \u003cb\u003e2,395+ reviews\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOver \u003cb\u003e8,500 families\u003c/b\u003e have purchased homes through Housiey across \u003cb\u003e8+ cities\u003c/b\u003e with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted \u003cb\u003e1.2 lakh+ free site visits\u003c/b\u003e and facilitated over \u003cb\u003e₹8,000 crore\u003c/b\u003e worth of property transactions.\",\"category\":\"Housiey\"}]},\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-08T12:44:09.056Z\"},\"BuilderD