s Play Area<br/>Clubhouse<br/>Yoga Meditation Deck<br/>Senior Citizen Area &amp; Many More<br/><br/>Veena Developers Blissful Living Kandivali West Parking -<br/>Project has one type of car parking facility -<br/>1) Parking Tower<br/><br/>Veena Blissful Living Possession -<br/>Rera Possession - December 2030<br/>Target Possession - December 2029<br/><br/>Carpet Area &amp; Floor Plan<br/>Blissful Living project has 2BHK premium residences with -<br/>2BHK - (604 to 719) sqft<br/><br/>Veena Blissful Living floor plan<br/>Tower floor plan will have 6 flats, 2 lifts &amp; 1 staircase on each floor<br/><br/>Veena Blissful Living Mumbai Prices &amp; its details can be found in the price section &amp; Veena Blissful Living Kandivali West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers &amp; Veena Developers Kandivali West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.</p></div></div></div></div></section></section><section id="location"><section id="location-section" class="w-full bg-white rounded-lg shadow"><div class="p-2 pl-3 bg-[#DEE4EA] flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-1"><span class="truncate min-w-0">Veena Blissful Living</span> <span class="whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">Location</span></h2></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row px-4 py-2 gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col flex-1 gap-4"><div><p class="text-[12px] md:text-[14px] font-[400] text-[rgba(109, 109, 109, 1)] mb-1">Near Mathuradas Rd, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai</p><div class="py-1 flex "><ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 my-1"><li><div class="text-[12px] md:text-[14px] flex items-center"><span class="font-[600] text-[#000000] rounded">Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 600m</span></div></li><li><div class="text-[12px] md:text-[14px] flex items-center"><span class="font-[600] text-[#000000] 