ex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate min-w-0">Project approved by</h2></div><div class="py-0 md:py-3"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div></section><!--/$--></section><section id="builder"><!--$--><section class="w-full bg-white rounded-lg shadow"><div class="p-2 pl-3 bg-[#DEE4EA] flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate min-w-0">About <!-- -->Veena Developers</h2></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-col md:items-start gap-3 md:gap-2 px-4 py-2"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start gap-0 md:gap-10"><div class="flex flex-row gap-5 justify-between"><div><p class="text-[14px] md:text-[16px] text-[#234e70] font-bold whitespace-nowrap">Veena Developers</p><div class="rounded p-3 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] mt-2"><img alt="Veena Developers" loading="lazy" width="150" height="56" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-fill w-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/veena-developers_1739972021466-151924400.webp 1x, https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/veena-developers_1739972021466-151924400.webp 2x" src="https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/veena-developers_1739972021466-151924400.webp"/></div></div><div><div class="mb-4"><p class="flex items-center mb-2 gap-2 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-sans font-semibold text-gray-700"><span class="md:hidden inline-flex items-center justify-center px-1.5 py-0.5 mt-0.5 rounded-sm text-xs text-primary font-semibold shadow-lg border border-[#DEE4EA] bg-[#f4f4f4] whitespace-nowrap">2<!-- --> <!-- -->Cities</span>Locations</p><div class="hidden md:flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-block bg-[#f4f4f4] text-[#234E70] px-2 py-1 rounded-sm text-sm font-semibold border border-[#DEE4EA]">Mumbai City</span><span class="inline-block bg-[#f4f4f4] text-[#234E70] px-2 py-1 rounded-sm text-sm font-semibold border border-[#DEE4EA]">Mumbai suburban</span></div><div class="md:hidden"><button type="button" class="text-[11px] font-medium line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer text-primary text-left" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-slot="popover-trigger">Mumbai City, Mumbai suburban</button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full flex flex-row md:flex-row items-center text-left justify-start md:justify-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><div class="flex bg-[#F4F4F4] md:items-center px-3.5 py-3 md:py-2 md:rounded-full gap-2 flex-col md:flex-row items-center text-center md:text-left"><span class="text-[#0e8744] font-bold md:text-base whitespace-nowrap order-1 md:order-2">34<!-- --> years</span><span class="text-[#234e70] font-bold md:font-semibold text-[12px] md:text-base order-2 md:order-1 md:after:content-[&#x27;:&#x27;] after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]">Experience</span></div><div class="flex bg-[#F4F4F4] md:items-center px-3.5 py-3 md:py-2 md:rounded-full gap-2 flex-col md:flex-row items-center text-center md:text-left"><span class="text-green-600 font-bold md:text-base order-1 md:order-2">30</span><span class="text-[#234e70] font-bold md:font-semibold text-[12px] md:text-base order-2 md:order-1 md:after:content-[&#x27;:&#x27;] after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] whitespace-nowrap">Total Projects</span></div><div class="flex bg-[#F4F4F4] md:items-center px-2 md:px-3.5 py-3 md:py-2 rounded-xs md:rounded-full gap-2 flex-col md:flex-row items-center text-center md:text-left"><span class="text-green-600 font-bold md:text-base order-1 md:order-2">5K<!-- -->+</span><span class="text-[#234e70] font-bold md:font-semibold text-[12px] md:text-base whitespace-nowrap order-2 md:order-1 md:after:content-[&#x27;:&#x27;] after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]">Happy Families</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 space-y-4"><div class="text-[12px] md:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><div class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-500 ease-in-out">Since its inception in 1990, Veena Developers have successfully delivered Residential, Corporate and Industrial Spaces with the essence of modernisation. Our persistent aim is to offer high-quality construction while also providing amenities for the convenience of our customers and their luxurious lifestyle.
We at Veena Developers have always believed that Integrity, Honesty and Trust are the pillars of our strength and we always strive to establish a long-term connection with our clients, one based on a solid foundation of trust. Our highly competent team of professionals perceive it as a mission to consistently work with a customer centric approach. We want our customers to feel comfortable and secure as we assist them in realising their goal of having a dream home that is not only a mark of their wealth but also a reflection of their lifestyle.
With Leadership of more than 30 years in the Real Estate industry, we believe that it is only the beginning for Veena Developers and that we have many more decades to demonstrate our endeavour to provide hassle-free customer experience in the Sector.</div></div><a href="/builder/veena-developers"><button data-slot="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive cursor-pointer h-9 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 bg-[#0e8744] hover:bg-[#0e8744] text-white text-[13px] md:text-base font-medium px-5 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition">View All Projects Now !</button></a></div></div></section><!--/$--></section><section id="faq"><!--$--><section class="w-full bg-white shadow h-[549px] md:h-[450px] flex flex-col mb-4"><div class="p-2 pl-3 bg-[#DEE4EA] flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate min-w-0">Frequently Asked Question</h2></div><div class="w-full px-2.5 md:px-6 flex-1 pb-4 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar"><div data-slot="accordion" class="mt-4 space-y-2.5" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-«R46mqm6ferb5lb»" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R6mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Can I visit the sample flat of Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="open" id="radix-«R46mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R6mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The sample flat is not ready yet. However, Housiey provides detailed floor plans, 3D walkthroughs, and virtual consultations with a property expert. Our team can explain the layout, unit sizes, and project details in detail.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Ramqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the expected possession date of Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4amqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Ramqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The expected possession date is <b>01 December 2030</b> as per RERA. Construction is currently <b>5%</b> complete as of August 4, 2026. Target possession is <b>01 December 2029</b>.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Remqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Is there any litigation against Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4emqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Remqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>No, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Rimqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What amenities are available in Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4imqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Rimqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>This project offers <b>15+</b> amenities. Key external amenities include Multi purpose hall, Terrace Garden, Gymnasium, party lawn, and Seating Area.<br> Internal specifications include Branded Fittings and Stainless Steel Sink. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Rmmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What are the monthly maintenance charges for Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4mmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Rmmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Monthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Rqmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the carpet area of a 2BHK in Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4qmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Rqmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>In Veena Blissful Living, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:<br>• <b>604 sq. ft.</b><br>• <b>620 sq. ft.</b><br>• <b>649 sq. ft.</b><br>• <b>719 sq. ft.</b><br>Each configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Rumqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4umqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Rumqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Veena Blissful Living starts from <b>₹1.86 Cr</b> and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.

<br>• <b>604 sq. ft.</b> – ₹1.86 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>• <b>620 sq. ft.</b> – ₹1.90 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>• <b>649 sq. ft.</b> – ₹1.99 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>• <b>719 sq. ft.</b> – ₹2.19 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>The price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R12mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What are the floor plans and configurations available in Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R52mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R12mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>It is built across <b>1 acres</b> with <b>1</b> towers with <b>G+38</b> floors. Each floor has <b>6</b> flats per floor, <b>2</b> lifts, <b>1</b> staircases. It is available in <b>2BHK</b> configurations with carpet areas ranging from <b>604</b> to <b>719 sq. ft.</b></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R16mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What type of parking is available in Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R56mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R16mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Veena Blissful Living provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Veena Blissful Living project page on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1amqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Where is Veena Blissful Living located? What are the nearby landmarks?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5amqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1amqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>It is located at <b>Near Mathuradas Rd, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali West, Mumbai</b>.<br>Nearby landmarks include:<br><b>• Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 600m </b><br><b>• SV Road - 1.2km </b><br><b>• Infinity Mall - 2.7km </b></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1emqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What payment plans are available for Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5emqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1emqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The following payment plans are available:<br>• <b>CLP ( Construction Link plan)</b> - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment  as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%<br><br><b>Note:</b> In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1imqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the minimum down payment required for Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5imqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1imqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The minimum down payment starts from <b>₹28.00 Lacs</b>, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1mmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Is Veena Blissful Living approved by banks for home loans?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5mmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1mmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Yes, it is approved by leading banks including <b>Central Bank of India</b>, <b>Union Bank of India</b>, <b>Bank Of India</b>, <b>Bank Of Baroda</b>, <b>Citi Bank</b>, <b>Kotak Mahindra Bank</b>, <b>Axis Bank</b>, <b>State Bank Of India</b>, <b>ICICI Bank</b>, <b>HDFC BANK</b>. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1qmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Is there any brokerage when buying Veena Blissful Living through Housiey?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5qmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1qmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>No - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1umqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Who is the developer of Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5umqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1umqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>It is developed by <b>Veena Developers</b>, a trusted real estate brand with over <b>34 years</b> of experience and more than <b>30 completed projects</b> across <b>Mumbai City and Mumbai suburban</b>.<br><b>Some of their notable developments include:</b><br><br> • <b>Veena Elevated Living</b> in Borivali West, Mumbai<br><br> • <b>Veena One Luxe</b> in Andheri West, Mumbai<br><br> • <b>Veena Synergy</b> in Andheri East, Mumbai<br><br> • <b>Veena Suyog</b> in Malad West, Mumbai<br><br> • <b>Veena Smart Homes</b> in Kandivali West, Mumbai</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R22mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Does Veena Blissful Living have CC and OC approvals?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R62mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R22mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The Commencement Certificate is available. The <b>Occupancy Certificate (OC)</b> will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R26mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Can I book a site visit for Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R66mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R26mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Yes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.<br><br>Alternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2amqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Can NRIs buy a flat in Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6amqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2amqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Yes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2emqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Why is Veena Blissful Living considered a good investment?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6emqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2emqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div><b>Kandivali West</b> is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.<br><br>This project by <b>Veena Developers</b> - with 34 years of experience - offers 2BHK at ₹1.86 Cr to ₹2.19 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2imqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Why should I buy Veena Blissful Living through Housiey instead of directly from the builder?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6imqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2imqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Buying through Housiey gives you:<br>(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price<br>(2) Free Ola cab site visit<br>(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home<br>(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal<br>(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project<br>All services are 100% free with no obligation.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2mmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">How can I download the price sheet or brochure of Veena Blissful Living?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6mmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2mmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the "Price Sheet" or "Brochure" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2qmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is Housiey&#x27;s rating and how many customers have bought homes through Housiey?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6qmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2qmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Housiey has a <b>4.8 rating</b> on Google with <b>2,395+ reviews</b>.<br><br>Over <b>8,500 families</b> have purchased homes through Housiey across <b>8+ cities</b> with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted <b>1.2 lakh+ free site visits</b> and facilitated over <b>₹8,000 crore</b> worth of property transactions.</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--></section><section id="similar-projects"><!--$--><section class="w-full bg-white rounded-lg shadow"><div class="p-2 pl-3 bg-[#DEE4EA] flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate min-w-0">Explore Related Projects</h2></div><div class="overflow-x-auto w-full"><div class="relative" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" data-slot="carousel"><div class="overflow-hidden" data-slot="carousel-content"><div class="flex ml-0 px-6 py-2 gap-3 items-stretch"><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" data-slot="carousel-item" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-full sm:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/3 lg:basis-[80%] xl:basis-[45%] pl-2 h-full"><div class="h-full transition-all duration-300 rounded-lg hover:shadow-[0px_12px_35px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] hover:-translate-y-1"><div class="bg-white px-3 py-2 flex flex-col gap-3 border border-border rounded-sm h-full"><div class="relative w-full rounded-md overflow-hidden group h-[180px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 skeleton-wrapper"><div data-slot="skeleton" class="bg-accent animate-pulse h-full w-full rounded"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer" id="fallback-726"><img alt="Dimple 73 East" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover cursor-pointer" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 210px) 100vw, (max-height: 1800px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/dimple-73-east_1777805092541-896027359-256w.webp 256w, https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/dimple-73-east_1777805092541-896027359-640